routes.doc:
查询当前目录下所有文件的提取状态. 前端轮询用.

返回结构:
{
  "files": {
    "01.pdf": {"status": "done", "extracted_path": "01_extracted.txt", ...},
    "02.pdf": {"status": "extracting", ...},
    "03.pdf": {"status": "failed", "error": "..."},
  },
  "summary": {"total": 3, "pending": 0, "extracting": 1, "done": 1, "failed": 1}
}
